        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy FLUX 3 Image- Bounding Box Edit\n\nPlace objects and text where you want them with FLUX 3 Image by feeding boxes from the Create Bounding Boxes node into the prompt, so each box carries its own description and copy into the render. Boxes are relative to the canvas, so set the output to the same aspect ratio. One image is output, up to 4K. Ideal for poster and layout composition, placing headlines and captions, and controlling where subjects sit in the frame.\n Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_bfl_flux3_image_bboxes.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
